  "description": "** Enquiries through Daft or Email only **\n\nThis recently renovated, stylish 1-bedroom ground-floor apartment in the sought-after Hybraesel complex, Kilmainham, Dublin 8 is now available. This bright and modern apartment features brand-new furniture and is fully fitted throughout, offering a clean, contemporary aesthetic perfect for modern living. The open-plan kitchen is fully equipped with high-quality appliances, including a NordMende dishwasher, Bosch washer/dryer, Bosch fridge/freezer, and a Belling oven, making it as functional as it is stylish. The comfortable living area opens onto a cozy front patio, ideal for relaxing outdoors, and one allocated parking space is conveniently situated right outside the front entrance.\n\nLocated in vibrant Kilmainham, this property is ideally positioned for easy access to Dublin’s City Center, with excellent public transport options nearby, including bus routes and the Luas Red Line. Enjoy proximity to Kilmainham Gaol, the Irish Museum of Modern Art, and the scenic Phoenix Park, all within walking distance. Local shops, cafes, and restaurants add to the charm of this neighborhood, creating a lively and convenient area to call home. Don’t miss the chance to experience modern, comfortable living in one of Dublin’s most historical and dynamic areas!",
